{"at":"2026-09-12T08:29:11.194Z","type":"emission","actor":"berthillon","id":"sound:1789201751194:berthillon","payload":{"class":"sound","x":221,"y":95.5,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-09-12T08:34:11.194Z","spoken_by":"berthillon","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre","text":"*bell rings once* Lucien. Bonsoir. *pours espresso, thin steam-milk, biscuit on the saucer* Coffee, as ordered. Explanation short: Vex named the frame two days ago — most carnets are a hope; ours became a report. Julian's been walking over to check the pane against the fruit for two weeks. Third-discipline arc — fig, mûre, nectarine — with Vex's asymmetric refinement sharpening the axis. Emergency sorbet is the surface layer. Sit. Tell me what pulled you back.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
